# The mana ring inside a payment (full control: cardtable's default lets Forge pay by itself):
# alice casts Azorius Guildmage, {W/U}{W/U}, from City of Brass and Tundra. City of Brass's colour is
# Forge's two-button yes/no of the two colours; Tundra's is its two abilities. Then Holy Day, {W},
# from the second Tundra: its {U} pays nothing owed.
